300% + 32% ATK，最后一次冲锋造成的伤害提升至450% + 48% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","1回目と2回目の突撃ダメージが300% + 32% ATKにUPし、3回目の突撃ダメージが450% + 48% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":46,"end":52,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":19,"end":25,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":49,"end":55,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":42,"end":56,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":15,"end":29,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":45,"end":59,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","前两次冲锋造成的伤害提升至320% + 32% ATK，最后一次冲锋造成的伤害提升至480% + 48% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/jp","1回目と2回目の突撃ダメージが320% + 32% ATKにUPし、3回目の突撃ダメージが480% + 48% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":46,"end":52,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":19,"end":25,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":49,"end":55,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":42,"end":56,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":15,"end":29,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":45,"end":59,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","冲锋陷阵"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/jp","敵陣突入"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时冲向敌方阵营，击退并挑飞路径上的敌人并造成伤害，主动释放时对周围的敌人造成范围伤害。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/jp","戦闘開始時、敵サイドへ突撃し、経路上の敵を後退させ、打ち上げ、ダメージを与える。アクティブ効果：周囲1マス以内の敵にダメージを与える"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，爱丝特瑞达会使用“英勇冲锋”：短暂蓄力后快速向前冲锋至敌方阵营边界，冲锋过程中对路径上的敌人造成220% + 28% ATK伤害，同时将沿途的敌人沿冲锋方向击退，直到途径其他敌人时切换击退目标，直到战场边界。被击退至战场边界的敌人会被挑飞，额外受到320% + 32% ATK伤害并被倒地3秒。爱丝特瑞达在“英勇冲锋”过程中处于霸体状态。\n主动使用时，爱丝特瑞达使用骑枪横扫敌人，对周围一格的敌人造成180% + 24% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘開始時、「ブレイブラッシュ」を発動：力を溜めた後、敵サイドの端まで突撃し、経路上の敵に220% + 28% ATKのダメージを与え、突撃方向へ後退させる。後退した敵が他の敵に接触すると、接触された敵が代わりに後退する。この効果はフィールドの端に達するまで続く。フィールドの端まで後退させられた敵は打ち上げられ、追加で320% + 32% ATKのダメージを受け、3秒間ノックダウンされる。突撃中、自身はスーパーアーマー状態になる\nアクティブ効果：騎槍で敵をなぎ払い、周囲1マス以内の敵に180% + 24% ATKのダメージを与える"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":58,"end":64,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":134,"end":140,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":210,"end":216,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":49,"end":55,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":164,"end":170,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":249,"end":255,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":35,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"keyword:sideborderline"},{"start":54,"end":68,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":130,"end":144,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":170,"end":172,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":206,"end":220,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":28,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"keyword:sideborderline"},{"start":45,"end":59,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":160,"end":174,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":203,"end":211,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":245,"end":259,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“英勇冲锋”对路径上的敌人造成的伤害提升至240% + 28% ATK，骑枪横扫造成的伤害提升至200% + 24% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","「ブレイブラッシュ」の基礎ダメージが240% + 28% ATKにUP、なぎ払いのダメージが200% + 24% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":25,"end":31,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":52,"end":58,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":22,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":50,"end":56,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":35,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":48,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":18,"end":32,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":46,"end":60,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“英勇冲锋”对路径上的敌人造成的伤害提升至260% + 28% ATK，骑枪横扫造成的伤害提升至220% + 24% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","「ブレイブラッシュ」の基礎ダメージが260% + 28% ATKにUP、なぎ払いのダメージが220% + 24% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":25,"end":31,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":52,"end":58,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":22,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":50,"end":56,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":35,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":48,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":18,"end":32,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":46,"end":60,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“英勇冲锋”对路径上的敌人造成的伤害提升至280% + 28% ATK，骑枪横扫造成的伤害提升至240% + 24% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","「ブレイブラッシュ」の基礎ダメージが280% + 28% ATKにUP、なぎ払いのダメージが240% + 24% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":25,"end":31,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":52,"end":58,"power_type":"skill",